  ✓ Audit input provenance, trusted-file integrity, and candidate artifacts
  ✓ Verify program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild K definitions and independently prove every positive claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, program pinning, and all K rules statically
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  → Account for assumptions, write REVIEW.md, and verify final markers/evidence
